<p>While in deeprock form, you become indomitable, granting you <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">23%, 33%, 40%, 45%, 49%</acronym> resistance to cuts, poisons, diseases and stuns.</p><p>At level 5 and higher, while Deeprock Form is active, all incoming damage is applied against physical resistance instead of the normal resistance type.</p>